> All actual steps, with a focused display

The next table shows the last eight steps of220/13 for readability; the captured
vector and plotted series still contain all64 actual steps. This display filter
does not rerun a shortened algorithm or relabel the iteration count as eight.
Leading-zero processing leaves the remainder zero until input bits become
significant.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/long_division_steps.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/long_division.hpp>
#include <datamunge/plot/plot.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
int main() {
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto t = dm::algorithms::long_division_trace(220, 13);
    std::vector<double> x, y;
    std::print("| actual original bit | prior remainder | actual trial | subtract | stored quotient | " "actual remainder |\n| ---: | ---: | ---: | --- | ---: | ---: |\n");
    for (auto &s : t.steps) {
        x.push_back(63 - s.bit);
        y.push_back(s.remainder);
        if (s.bit < 8)
            std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", s.bit, s.before,
                       s.trial, s.subtracted, s.quotient, s.remainder);
    }
    std::print("\nActual capture records {}; actual iterations {}.\n",
               t.steps.size(), t.result.iterations);
    auto p = dm::graphics::RPlot::create();
    p.line(x, y, "all actual remainders", {37, 99, 235}, 2).x_label(
        "actual step index, beginning at dividend bit63").y_label(
        "actual committed remainder").title("All64 native steps of220/13").save_svg("build/long_division_steps.svg");
}
```
