| 18446744073709551615 | 18446744073709551615 | 1 | 0 | 64 |
| 18446744073709551615 | 18446744073709551614 | 1 | 1 | 64 |
| 18446744073709551615 | 9223372036854775808 | 1 | 9223372036854775807 | 64 |

Actual zero-divisor rejection true.
